  "description": "Baek Eun-Su, the perfectionist head of the R&D team born into a family of educators, and Han Yu-I, a new hire who is the “perfect daughter” from a wealthy family but more honest than anyone else. Their peaceful work life is shattered one day by the sudden emergence of “psychometry” abilities. A workplace life that feels like a dizzying “living arrangement” (?) between a man who doesn’t want to know others’ secrets and a woman with hidden feelings she doesn’t want exposed. An unexpected romance blossoms amid the bickering chemistry between the obsessive-compulsive team leader and the trouble-making new hire. Will the two of them be able to survive even after facing each other’s most deeply hidden truths?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
